格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Browser4 — an AI-native browser engine for autonomous agents, intelligent extraction, and large-scale web automation.","id":"gh:1335289663","install_available":true,"language":"PowerShell","name":"dsh-browser4","slug":"platonai/dsh-browser4","topics":["agent-browser","ai-browser","browser-os","crawler","deepsee","deepseek","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Browser4 — an AI-native browser engine for autonomous agents, intelligent extraction, and large-scal"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"native browser engine for autonomous agents, intelligent extraction, and large-scale web automation."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# 🤖 Browser4"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**Project:** github.com/platonai/Browser4 · **Website:** browser4.io"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"English | 简体中文 | 中国镜像"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"**Table of Contents**\n- 🤖 Browser4\n- 🌟 Introduction\n- ✨ Key Capabilities\n- 📦 Installation\n- Install "},{"id":"p5s2","text":"DeepSeek Harness (DSH)\n- Install the Browser4 plugin (recommended)\n- Start DSH\n- Use Browser4 in DSH"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"\n- Install browser4-cli (Optional)\n- Install-free usage (optional)\n- Quick Start\n- 🧭 Tool Selection "},{"id":"p5s4","text":"Guide\n- How to Interact with a Page\n- How to Extract Data\n- How to Process at Scale\n- How to Turn HT"},{"id":"p5s5","text":"ML into Spreadsheets — Zero Tokens\n- 💡 CLI Guide for Humans\n- Quick start\n- Mental model\n- Global op"},{"id":"p5s6","text":"tions\n- Key concepts before the command list\n- Complete command reference\n- Timeout environment vari"},{"id":"p5s7","text":"ables\n- State persistence\n- 🚀 Build from Source\n- Architecture\n- 📦 Modules Overview\n- 🧪 Test Fixture"},{"id":"p5s8","text":" Server (MockSite)\n- 🤝 Support & Community\n- 📜 Documentation\n- 🔧 Proxy Configuration\n- License"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## 🌟 Introduction"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"💖 **Browser4 — an AI-native browser engine for autonomous agents, intelligent extraction, and large-"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"scale web automation.** 💖"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"### ✨ Key Capabilities"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"* 🤖 **Agent Browser** — Enable AI agents to browse, interact, and automate real-world websites.\n* 🧠 "},{"id":"p9s2","text":"**ML-Powered Extraction** — Learn page structures and extract structured data without LLM token cost"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"s.\n* ⚡ **High-Performance Runtime** — Coroutine-safe architecture supporting 100k–200k complex page "},{"id":"p9s4","text":"visits per machine per day.\n* 🧬 **Hybrid Intelligence** — Combine LLM, ML, X-SQL, and selectors for "},{"id":"p9s5","text":"robust extraction and experience reuse.\n* 📦 **Enterprise-Scale Automation** — Large-scale web access"},{"id":"p9s6","text":", CDP-native control, batch jobs, stateful sessions, plugins, extensions, and more."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## 📦 Installation"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"### 1. Install DeepSeek Harness (DSH)"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"First check whether DSH is already installed:"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"If the command prints a version number, DSH is ready — go to the next step. If the command is not fo"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"und, install it by OS:"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"**macOS**"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Install Node.js 20 or later, then install DSH:"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"**Windows**"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Install Node.js LTS in PowerShell:"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Reopen PowerShell after installation, then install DSH:"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"Run `dsh --version` again to confirm DSH works."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"### 2. Install the Browser4 plugin (recommended)"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Install `dsh-browser4` as a DSH plugin bundle — from the npm registry or straight from GitHub:"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Installing the package runs its installer script (`scripts/install-browser4.mjs`), which:"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"1. Installs `browser4-cli` following the browser4-cli SKILL installation process (`npm install -g br"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"owser4-cli` → `browser4-cli install`, falling back to the platform bootstrap script when npm is unav"},{"id":"p28s3","text":"ailable).\n2. Unpacks the SKILL files with `browser4-cli skills unpack` into `~/.dsh/skills` and `~/."},{"id":"p28s4","text":"agents/skills` (honouring `$DSH_HOME` / `$DSH_AGENTS_HOME`), so every DSH profile and preset discove"},{"id":"p28s5","text":"rs the `browser4-cli`, `browser4-experience`, `browser4-plugin`, and `scent-miner` skills."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"The bundle also registers a skill-provider layer (`cordis.patch.yml`) that serves the same skills di"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"rectly from the installed package's `skills/` directory."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"> **The unpacked skills are the version embedded in your local `browser4-cli` binary.** `browser4-cl"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"i skills unpack` reads the skill files compiled into the CLI itself, not the copies shipped in this "},{"id":"p30s3","text":"npm package. This is intentional: the agent's instructions always match the exact command set, optio"},{"id":"p30s4","text":"ns, and behaviour of the CLI actually installed on the machine — no network fetch, no version drift."},{"id":"p30s5","text":" After upgrading `browser4-cli`, just run `browser4-cli skills unpack` again to refresh."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"A shorter alias works too: `dsh plugin --profile web add b4@github:platonai/dsh-browser4`."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"> **pnpm ≥ 10 blocks dependency build scripts by default.** If `add` fails with a build-permission e"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"rror, copy the exact package key pnpm prints into the profile's `pnpm-workspace.yaml` (under `$DSH_H"},{"id":"p32s3","text":"OME/profiles/web/`) and re-run the command:\n>\n[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"Installing from a local checkout (`dsh plugin --profile web add ./dsh-browser4`) links the package w"},{"id":"p33s2","text":"ithout running lifecycle scripts — run the installer once manually afterwards:"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"## Architecture"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"- **CLI** (`cli/browser4-cli`) — native Rust binary, talks to the backend via MCP tool calls\n- **Bac"},{"id":"p37s2","text":"kend** (`browser4-rest`) — Spring Boot server, dispatches MCP tools to browser drivers\n- **Browser d"},{"id":"p37s3","text":"river** (`browser4-core/browser4-browser`) — wraps Chrome DevTools Protocol\n- **Agent tools** (`brow"},{"id":"p37s4","text":"ser4-agentic`) — maps MCP tool names to browser automation methods"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"## 📦 Modules Overview"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"| Module | Description                                                          |"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"| `cli/browser4-cli` | Rust CLI — fast, native binary for browser automation                |\n| `ski"},{"id":"p40s2","text":"lls/browser4-cli` | AI agent skill definitions (SKILL.md)                                |\n| `browse"},{"id":"p40s3","text":"r4-core` | Core engine: sessions, scheduling, DOM, browser control              |\n| `browser4-depend"},{"id":"p40s4","text":"encies` | BOM and dependency version alignment                                 |\n| `browser4-tools` "},{"id":"p40s5","text":"| Operational tools and launch helpers                                 |\n| `browser4-agentic` | AI a"},{"id":"p40s6","text":"gents, MCP integration, skill registration                       |\n| `browser4-agent-tools` | High-l"},{"id":"p40s7","text":"evel agent tools: scraping, crawling, stateful page interaction |\n| `browser4-rest` | Spring Boot RE"},{"id":"p40s8","text":"ST layer & command endpoints                           |\n| `browser4-apps/browser4-standalone` | Pro"},{"id":"p40s9","text":"duct packaging — unified launcher (`target/Browser4.jar`)         |\n| `examples/browser4-examples` |"},{"id":"p40s10","text":" Runnable examples and demos                                          |\n| `browser4-tests` | E2E, in"},{"id":"p40s11","text":"tegration, and scenario test suites                           |\n| `cdp-protocol` | Chrome DevTools P"},{"id":"p40s12","text":"rotocol JSON definitions                            |\n| `coworker/` | Builtin AI coworker           "},{"id":"p40s13","text":"                                       |"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
